completed_at: "2026-08-02T21:34:12.981Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: "Clone creates a repository, registers origin, fetches every branch onto tracking refs, creates the local branch the source HEAD names, and materializes the working tree; the clone's config.json equals the source's; cloning into an existing repository is refused; a source whose HEAD is unborn clones to an empty working tree without failing; a transport URL scheme the build cannot serve is refused by name rather than being treated as a directory"
parent: pm-vcs-wm40
close_reason: "Shipped in the distribution tranche: remotes, transport interface, fetch/push/clone with reachability negotiation, 100/100/100 coverage."
